{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SXQwUH7YXuUSzgAZhgJduT","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, I found information about **Kafka Streams state stores and record headers configuration**:\\\\n\\\\n## KIP-1271: Allow to Store Record Headers in State Stores\\\\n\\\\n**Key Configuration & Design Details:**\\\\n\\\\n1. **Configuration for Header Capacity:**\\\\n   - Configuration parameter: `streams.store.headers.max.bytes` \\\\n   - This sets the maximum size limit for headers stored in state stores\\\\n   - Source: `kips-and-discussions.md` (Window 6, Matthias J. Sax feedback - 2026-01-12)\\\\n\\\\n2. **Purpose:**\\\\n   - Enables Kafka Streams state stores to preserve record headers alongside values\\\\n   - Preserves header-based metadata such as schema IDs, tracing info, and feature flags\\\\n   - Source: `window-5-summary.md` (KAFKA-20056 description)\\\\n\\\\n3. **Final Design Elements:**\\\\n   - **HeaderByteStore interface** - serves as marker interface for backward compatibility to distinguish header-aware stores from regular stores\\\\n   - **Header-aware store types** - with configurable header size cap\\\\n   - **New method overloads** - StateSerdes methods with Headers parameter\\\\n   - **Deprecation strategy** - for existing StateSerdes methods when new overloads added\\\\n   - Source: `window-6-summary.md` (Matthias J. Sax detailed feedback on KIP-1271 - 2026-01-12T01:39:08Z)\\\\n\\\\n4. **Related JIRA Issue:**\\\\n   - KAFKA-20056: \\\\\\\"Allow to Store Record Headers in State Stores\\\\\\\"\\\\n   - Created 2026-01-09T19:58:02Z by Alieh Saeedi\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited:**\\\\n- `/store/window-5-summary.md` - Lines 154-165, 222-231\\\\n- `/store/window-6-summary.md` - Lines 333-354\\\\n- `/store/kips-and-discussions.md` - Lines 1087-1101, 1271-1299\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"jira-issues.md\\\",\\\"kips-and-discussions.md\\\",\\\"window-5-summary.md\\\",\\\"window-6-summary.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":29.3,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":305005,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":72278,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.18624250000000003,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2224}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c4d52df-0ff3-436a-be62-ce8dcb15d6c3","uuid":"c31c7577-6d9e-4103-bb67-6ec81a0eb506","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:34:26.414Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, I found information about **Kafka Streams state stores and record headers configuration**:\\\\n\\\\n## KIP-1271: Allow to Store Record Headers in State Stores\\\\n\\\\n**Key Configuration & Design Details:**\\\\n\\\\n1. **Configuration for Header Capacity:**\\\\n   - Configuration parameter: `streams.store.headers.max.bytes` \\\\n   - This sets the maximum size limit for headers stored in state stores\\\\n   - Source: `kips-and-discussions.md` (Window 6, Matthias J. Sax feedback - 2026-01-12)\\\\n\\\\n2. **Purpose:**\\\\n   - Enables Kafka Streams state stores to preserve record headers alongside values\\\\n   - Preserves header-based metadata such as schema IDs, tracing info, and feature flags\\\\n   - Source: `window-5-summary.md` (KAFKA-20056 description)\\\\n\\\\n3. **Final Design Elements:**\\\\n   - **HeaderByteStore interface** - serves as marker interface for backward compatibility to distinguish header-aware stores from regular stores\\\\n   - **Header-aware store types** - with configurable header size cap\\\\n   - **New method overloads** - StateSerdes methods with Headers parameter\\\\n   - **Deprecation strategy** - for existing StateSerdes methods when new overloads added\\\\n   - Source: `window-6-summary.md` (Matthias J. Sax detailed feedback on KIP-1271 - 2026-01-12T01:39:08Z)\\\\n\\\\n4. **Related JIRA Issue:**\\\\n   - KAFKA-20056: \\\\\\\"Allow to Store Record Headers in State Stores\\\\\\\"\\\\n   - Created 2026-01-09T19:58:02Z by Alieh Saeedi\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited:**\\\\n- `/store/window-5-summary.md` - Lines 154-165, 222-231\\\\n- `/store/window-6-summary.md` - Lines 333-354\\\\n- `/store/kips-and-discussions.md` - Lines 1087-1101, 1271-1299\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"jira-issues.md\\\",\\\"kips-and-discussions.md\\\",\\\"window-5-summary.md\\\",\\\"window-6-summary.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":29.3,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":305005,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":72278,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.18624250000000003,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2224}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on the context filesystem, I found information about **Kafka Streams state stores and record headers configuration**:\\n\\n## KIP-1271: Allow to Store Record Headers in State Stores\\n\\n**Key Configuration & Design Details:**\\n\\n1. **Configuration for Header Capacity:**\\n   - Configuration parameter: `streams.store.headers.max.bytes` \\n   - This sets the maximum size limit for headers stored in state stores\\n   - Source: `kips-and-discussions.md` (Window 6, Matthias J. Sax feedback - 2026-01-12)\\n\\n2. **Purpose:**\\n   - Enables Kafka Streams state stores to preserve record headers alongside values\\n   - Preserves header-based metadata such as schema IDs, tracing info, and feature flags\\n   - Source: `window-5-summary.md` (KAFKA-20056 description)\\n\\n3. **Final Design Elements:**\\n   - **HeaderByteStore interface** - serves as marker interface for backward compatibility to distinguish header-aware stores from regular stores\\n   - **Header-aware store types** - with configurable header size cap\\n   - **New method overloads** - StateSerdes methods with Headers parameter\\n   - **Deprecation strategy** - for existing StateSerdes methods when new overloads added\\n   - Source: `window-6-summary.md` (Matthias J. Sax detailed feedback on KIP-1271 - 2026-01-12T01:39:08Z)\\n\\n4. **Related JIRA Issue:**\\n   - KAFKA-20056: \\\"Allow to Store Record Headers in State Stores\\\"\\n   - Created 2026-01-09T19:58:02Z by Alieh Saeedi\\n\\n**Files cited:**\\n- `/store/window-5-summary.md` - Lines 154-165, 222-231\\n- `/store/window-6-summary.md` - Lines 333-354\\n- `/store/kips-and-discussions.md` - Lines 1087-1101, 1271-1299\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"jira-issues.md\",\"kips-and-discussions.md\",\"window-5-summary.md\",\"window-6-summary.md\"],\"seconds\":29.3,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":305005,\"cache_write_tokens\":72278,\"cost_usd\":0.18624250000000003,\"input_tokens\":66,\"output_tokens\":2224}}"}}}
